      "text": "http -> use req and res - use for only \n          text data (Form data)\nhttps -> use req and res (it is secure)\nFTP -> use req, file and callback - It is \n          use for read file which is send \n          from frontend. It is break the \n          file into small chunks and divide.\nSMTP -> use from, to, subject - It is use\n            for sending an email.\nWeb-Socket -> use two way communication\n                  examples - chats, video call\n                  voice call, etc.",
      "fontSize": 20,
